    "licenseNotice": "LICENSE.libvterm.txt",
    "recordedDeviations": [
      "DanTerm emits strict xterm legacy encodings where pinned libvterm emits unsolicited fixterms CSI-u for modified letters, Space, and Tab.",
      "DanTerm retains host focus while mode 1004 is disabled and answers every enable with the state it holds, as foot does; pinned libvterm reports only transitions that happen while the mode is enabled."
